sult, end = _TokenizingJSONObject((content, 1), True, fake_scan_once, {}, content)\n    assert result == {}\n    assert end == 2\n\ndef test_empty_object_with_whitespace():\n    content = \"{ }\"\n    result, end = _TokenizingJSONObject((content, 1), True, fake_scan_once, {}, content)\n    assert result == {}\n    assert end == 3\n```\n\nTrace `{ }`: end=1, nextchar=' ' \u2192 ws \u2192 end=2, nextchar='}' \u2192 return ({}, 3). Good \u2014 covers 42 via the whitespace path.\n\n```python\ndef test_invalid_property_name():\n    content = \"{,}\"\n    with pytest.raises(JSONDecodeError) as exc:\n        _TokenizingJSONObject((content, 1), True, fake_scan_once, {}, content)\n    assert exc.value.msg == \"Expecting property name enclosed in double quotes\"\n    assert exc.value.pos == 1\n```\n\nJSONDecodeError attributes: msg, pos, lineno, colno, doc. Good.\n\n```python\ndef test_missing_colon():\n    content = '{\"a\" 1}'\n    with pytest.raises(JSONDecodeError) as exc:\n        _TokenizingJSONObject((content, 1), True, fake_scan_once, {}, content)\n    assert exc.value.msg == \"Expecting ':' delimiter\"\n    assert exc.value.pos == 5\n```\n\nTrace: end=1\u2192'\"'\u2192end=2. scanstring(s,2)\u2192('a',4). s[4]=' ' != ':' \u2192 end=_w(s,4).end()=5. s[5]='1' != ':' \u2192 raise at pos 5. Good.\n\n```python\ndef test_truncated_after_colon():\n    content = '{\"a\":'\n    with pytest.raises(JSONDecodeError) as exc:\n        _TokenizingJSONObject((content, 1), True, fake_scan_once, {}, content)\n    assert exc.value.msg == \"Expecting value\"\n    assert exc.value.pos == 5\n```\n\nTrace: end=5 after colon. s[5] \u2192 IndexError \u2192 pass. fake(s,5): idx >= len(s) \u2192 StopIteration(5) \u2192 JSONDecodeError(\"Expecting value\", s, 5). Good. Covers 67-68, 72-73.\n\n```python\ndef test_multiple_whitespace_after_colon():\n    content = '{\"a\":  1}'\n    result, end = _TokenizingJSONObject((content, 1), True, fake_scan_once, {}, content)\n    assert end == len(content)\